Z||000005||wkayl||02-23-2000||02:30 PM||||I pulled into a gas station to fill my 86GT.  after I stopped at the pumps, I looked in rear view mirror and saw smoke billowing out of engine vents.  I threw open the deck lid and the smoke billowed up and disapeared.  I couldn't figure it untill I restarted the engine and saw the alt. belt smoking.  whew!!!!!!  I have never seen a Fiero burn, but  have have had people tell me that back in ought six they had a friend who had a cousin married to a priest who's siser's husband remembers seeing a story about one that did.||||reg||1
